{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1785993911760698001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"wormy-sod-gorge","assignee":"Joe Oakhart","attestations":{"plan-review":{"algorithm":"HMAC-SHA256","author":"Joe Oakhart","head_sha":"19fe0c1d8fe54fd07d5f22f04352b493b7972739","key_id":"412fa5372ad877e0","kind":"plan-review","manifest":["plan-review: PASS","ticket: 7e0c-e76a-75c5-420d","material: ae893f175059d4b6","model: claude-sonnet-4-6","runner: pydantic_ai","blocking: 0","advisory: 5","rebar-version: 0.5.2 (19fe0c1d8-dirty)","regver: bb57585159a067c5","verified-at-sha:19fe0c1d8fe54fd07d5f22f04352b493b7972739","dep 102ce7ba5de56be24047a25d8a615d8426eb65e6c321a2423f42f5bf9a0adf3e pyproject.toml","dep 2f7fe1a9e753699e9ed23c53ef5c123ced7b213daa1d18dd6182204da1575b47 server.json"],"signature":"007cc55f5428c8d28ff6888f4ef43a699d330a94354d6017de949059657824dc","signed_at":1783302677159509000}},"author":"Joe Oakhart","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":8},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"Joe Oakhart","body":"Version bump (0.7.0) pushed to Gerrit as change 315 (Change-Id I6f48545). Awaiting LLM-Review + Verified before submit + tag.","timestamp":1783302844252641001},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","body":"Release v0.7.0 channel status:\n- pyproject.toml + server.json 0.7.0: MERGED (change 315). ✓\n- PyPI: 0.7.0 live. ✓\n- GitHub Release: v0.7.0 exists + marked Latest, artifacts attached. NOTE: created MANUALLY (one-off) — the auto github_release job FAILED on the v0.7.0 tag (gh had no repo context; run 28763401143). Dogfood found the bug; fix (GH_REPO) merged as change 316 (bug 8ed5, closed). The AC 'created automatically by the workflow' was NOT met for v0.7.0 specifically — it WILL be met on the next tag release (v0.7.1+) via the merged fix.\n- Homebrew tap: Formula/rebar.rb bumped to 0.7.0 (url+sha256), pushed to navapbc/homebrew-rebar. ✓\n- Smoke test: published 0.7.0 passes end-to-end (init/create/claim/comment/close/fsck + rebar-mcp). Full probe blocked only by no-TTY auto-init in the bg shell (not a 0.7.0 defect). ✓\n- MCP Registry: BLOCKED — publisher token expired; needs interactive `mcp-publisher login github` (browser/device auth) which cannot run headlessly. Awaiting operator login, then `mcp-publisher publish` of server.json (0.7.0).\n\nTicket stays in_progress until MCP Registry is published.","timestamp":1783305281872504001}],"created_at":1783302151149679001,"creation_channel":"unknown","deps":[],"description":"## What\nCut the **v0.7.0** minor release of `nava-rebar` following `docs/releasing.md`, and\nin doing so **dogfood** the newly-merged `github_release` job (ticket\nf112-6222-e236-4b09, change 314): pushing the `v0.7.0` tag must now *automatically*\ncreate the GitHub Release — no manual `gh release create`. 198 commits have landed\nsince v0.6.0 (grounding pyright backend, typed public return contracts, MCP tool\nannotations, supply-chain hardening, plus many fixes/docs), so a minor bump is warranted.\n\n## Scope / steps (per docs/releasing.md)\n- Bump `pyproject.toml` `version` and `server.json` (`version` + `packages[0].version`) to 0.7.0.\n- Land the \"Release 0.7.0\" bump commit on `main` through Gerrit (both votes).\n- Tag `v0.7.0` and push the tag → `release.yml` publishes to PyPI (OIDC) and the new\n  `github_release` job auto-creates the GitHub Release.\n- Update the Homebrew tap (`navapbc/homebrew-rebar` `Formula/rebar.rb`: url + sha256).\n- Update the MCP Registry (`mcp-publisher publish` of `server.json`).\n- Post-release smoke test (`scripts/probe-rebar.sh` against the published artifact).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `pyproject.toml` and `server.json` both read version 0.7.0 and the bump is merged to main via Gerrit.\n- [ ] PyPI shows nava-rebar 0.7.0 live.\n- [ ] The GitHub Release for v0.7.0 was created **automatically** by the workflow (not by hand) and is marked Latest.\n- [ ] Homebrew formula points at the 0.7.0 sdist (correct url + sha256).\n- [ ] MCP Registry serves io.github.navapbc/rebar at 0.7.0.\n- [ ] Post-release probe passes against the published artifact.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":"pyproject.toml","reason":"bump version to 0.7.0"},{"path":"server.json","reason":"bump version + packages[0].version to 0.7.0"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"4b0ba324-6253-486e-a3c6-927c284eeb7e","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"7e0c-e76a-75c5-420d","ticket_type":"task","title":"Release nava-rebar 0.7.0 across all channels (dogfood auto GitHub Release)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["a3c00265-61d2-4a85-aa02-aec069acc9e7","b521d773-30f1-4633-a822-63d772cfb47e","b821c6d2-0bcf-424b-b9bb-027cc4d71e53","163cf717-b50c-46a6-b9ff-55248555ea64","4b0ba324-6253-486e-a3c6-927c284eeb7e","ef21c7b7-3223-44d3-b647-7e88bd3b9ea8","ee96dbd9-272c-481c-90a8-203eace5ab25","76fedfbf-fe3d-4005-9699-28d6f6e61af3","7ab0d02a-ce16-47d1-adf6-92645fc103c5"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785993911760698001,"uuid":"d791f7b6-df28-48a2-b548-ac9be4f99538"}